1795344208598	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-6604196090484045367"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:28.598-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:28.598-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer1"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"दुई नदीको बीचमा"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"वर्षा, पहाड र मिथकले कसरी मानव सभ्यतालाई जन्म दिए आधुनिक टर्कीको पूर्वी उच्च भेगमा चुनढुङ्गा र बेसाल्ट चट्टानको एउटा खस्रो र अग्लो पहाडी पर्खाल उभिएको छ, जसले एनाटोलियाका उपत्यकाहरूलाई मेसोपोटामिया (Mesopotamia) का समथर फाँटहरूबाट अलग गर्छ। सहस्राब्दियौँदेखि तीन हजार मिटरभन्दा अग्ला यी शिखरहरूले पूर्वमा एसिया र दक्षिणमा हिन्द महासागरतिरबाट बग्दै आउने वर्षे बादलहरूलाई छेकेर राख्दै आएका छन्। ती अग्ल"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/6604196090484045367/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/dui-nadiko-bichma-mesopotamia-sumer-sabhyata.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/6604196090484045367"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/6604196090484045367"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/dui-nadiko-bichma-mesopotamia-sumer-sabhyata.html","title":"दुई नदीको बीचमा"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://